                        "entry_id": "895f35a1-d0da-3afc-be43-4b98179aebac",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A tree, Antiaris toxicaria, of the mulberry family, common in the forests of Java and the neighboring islands, with poisonous secretions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcd29495-b238-4289-bc72-5acb455f5d3b",
                                "sense_id": "66578db1-eb8f-33bb-80f8-0ea6445ac5e0",
                                "text": "[I]t is an all-blasting upas, whose root is earth, and whose leaves are the skies which rain their poison-dews upon mankind."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6952f29c-3ff8-3c3e-a830-7706ac5c6f30",
                        "entry_id": "895f35a1-d0da-3afc-be43-4b98179aebac",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A virulent poison used in Java and the adjacent islands for poisoning arrows derived from the tree."
